WEBVTT

00:00:29.836 --> 00:00:33.436
but first, why do we need carbon removals?

00:00:34.476 --> 00:00:36.236
Because I know what you’re thinking:

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:39.636
isn’t it easier to stop
putting the carbon in the atmosphere

00:00:39.636 --> 00:00:40.636
in the first place?

00:00:40.756 --> 00:00:43.196
And the answer is yes, of course it is.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.236
We have to do everything we can
as fast as we can

00:00:46.236 --> 00:00:48.716
to stop carbon getting into the sky

00:00:48.716 --> 00:00:51.436
and stop climate change getting worse.

00:00:52.196 --> 00:00:55.676
That should not be a controversial
point of view at this meeting.

00:00:57.756 --> 00:01:00.316
But the problem is ...